# Line-ending policy for this repository.
#
# README.md is carriage-return and line-feed terminated on every one of its lines, and it was
# that way before this engagement began. card-platform/docs/onboarding.md and every file under
# card-platform/ is line-feed terminated. Nothing here converts either form: no `text`, `eol` or
# `working-tree-encoding` attribute is set, so every file is stored and checked out byte for byte
# as it is committed.
#
# The one attribute below tells git's whitespace checker that a carriage return before the line
# feed is this file's normal ending rather than trailing whitespace. Without it,
# `git diff --check` reports every added line of README.md as a defect and exits 2, which is what
# a reviewer running it saw.
#
# Rationale, alternatives considered and accepted risks:
# card-platform/docs/decision-log.md.

README.md whitespace=cr-at-eol
